Pumpkin Butter Bliss starts with a soft pumpkin-spiced cookie and loads it with semisweet chocolate chips and pumpkin spice chips for layers of chocolate, warm spice, and cozy fall flavor.

Pumpkin butter brings even more rich pumpkin goodness to every bite, making this one soft, warmly spiced, chocolatey, and unapologetically made for pumpkin season.', '', '2026-09-21', 3, '', '', 'Available', 'pumpkin-butter-bliss', '', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
