Inside is a gooey s''mores spread, while a graham cracker base and toasted marshmallow finish bring the full campfire effect. It is nutty, melty, gooey, and built for anyone who wants peanut butter and s''mores in the same oversized OBA cookie.', 'Our Campfire Crunch with a PB twist, loaded with Reese''s, peanut butter chips, chocolate & marshmallow, baked on graham cracker and finished with toasted marshmallow.', '2026-07-18', 11, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'peanut-campfire-crunch', 'images/peanut-campfire-crunch.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
