No stuffing, drizzle, or pile of toppings required—just a really good cookie proving that sometimes simple is the sweetest.', 'A soft, buttery vanilla cookie with crisp golden edges and a perfectly soft center. Sometimes simple is the sweetest.', '2026-06-27', 12, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'plain-jane', 'images/plain-jane.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('the-marble-cookie', 'The Marble Cookie', 'regular', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-002', 'Seasonal Flavor', 400, 'A soft cookies & cream cookie packed with Oreo pieces, white chocolate chips, and Hershey’s Cookies ’n’ Creme, then finished with a sweet vanilla drizzle.', 'A Cookies & Cream dream packed with Oreo pieces, white chocolate chips, Hershey''s Cookies ''n'' Creme, and finished with a sweet vanilla drizzle.', 'A Cookies & Cream Dream.
The Marble Cookie is OBA’s full-on cookies & cream dream. A soft cookie is packed with Oreo pieces, creamy white chocolate chips, and chunks of Hershey’s Cookies ’n’ Creme for layers of chocolate-cookie crunch and sweet vanilla creaminess.

A sweet vanilla drizzle finishes the cookie on top, adding one more creamy note to every bite. The result is soft, rich, crunchy, and unapologetically packed with cookies & cream goodness.', '', '2026-06-07', 13, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'the-marble-cookie', 'images/the-marble-cookie.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('twilight-marble', 'Twilight Marble', 'regular', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-018', 'Seasonal Flavor', 400, 'A rich chocolate cookies & cream cookie loaded with crushed Oreos, white chocolate chips, and Hershey’s Cookies ’n’ Creme for a soft, fudgy, chocolate-packed bite.', 'A rich, soft baked chocolate cookie loaded with crushed Oreos, creamy white chocolate chips, and chunks of Hershey’s Cookies ’n’ Creme. Fudgy, gooey, and packed with cookies & cream goodness in every bite.', 'Cookies & Cream After Dark.
Twilight Marble starts with a rich, soft-baked chocolate cookie and turns the cookies & cream dial all the way up. Crushed Oreo pieces run through the dough alongside creamy white chocolate for a mix of deep cocoa and sweet vanilla.

Chunks of Hershey''s Cookies ''n'' Creme add even more creamy, crunchy texture, while the soft center keeps every bite fudgy and gooey. It''s a darker, richer spin on cookies & cream made for anyone who wants a little bit of everything in one cookie.', '', '2026-08-15', 14, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'twilight-marble', 'images/twilight-marble.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('chocolate-cosmo', 'Chocolate Cosmo', 'regular', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-017', 'Seasonal Flavor', 400, 'A thick, soft, fudgy chocolate cookie inspired by the nostalgic cosmic brownie and topped with colorful candy-coated chocolate pieces for extra sweetness and crunch.', 'A rich, fudgy chocolate cookie topped with colorful candy coated chocolate pieces, inspired by the nostalgic cosmic brownie. Soft, decadent, and out of this world.', 'Chocolate Cosmo takes the nostalgic cosmic brownie idea and turns it into a thick, soft OBA cookie. The chocolate base is rich and fudgy, with a brownie-like depth in every bite.

Colorful candy-coated chocolate pieces add little pops of sweetness and crunch throughout, making this one feel playful, decadent, and just a little out of this world.', '', '2026-08-01', 15, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'chocolate-cosmo', 'images/chocolate-cosmo.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('midnight-mocha', 'Midnight Mocha', 'regular', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-006', 'Classic', 400, 'A fudgy double chocolate brownie-style cookie loaded with dark chocolate chunks and milk chocolate chips, with a hint of espresso for an extra-deep, rich chocolate flavor.', 'A fudgy double chocolate brownie cookie loaded with dark chocolate chunks, milk chocolate chips, and a hint of espresso for a deep, rich chocolate flavor.', 'Dark, Fudgy, and Made for Chocolate Lovers.
Midnight Mocha leans all the way into chocolate. A fudgy double chocolate brownie-style cookie brings a deep cocoa base, while dark chocolate chunks and milk chocolate chips add pockets of rich, melty sweetness throughout.

A hint of espresso rounds everything out without turning it into a coffee cookie — it simply makes the chocolate taste darker, richer, and more intense. It''s an OBA classic for anyone who likes their cookies on the decadent side.', '', '2026-06-20', 16, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'midnight-mocha', 'images/midnight-mocha.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('loaded-monster', 'Loaded Monster', 'specialty', 500, 0, 'active', 'OBA-014', 'Specialty', 500, 'A thick, chewy oatmeal monster cookie loaded with chocolate chips, peanut butter chips, M&M’s, crunchy pretzels, and buttery toffee bits for a sweet-and-salty bite.', 'A thick oatmeal cookie loaded with chocolate chips, peanut butter chips, M&M, crunchy pretzels, and buttery toffee bits. Sweet, salty, chewy, and packed with something delicious in every bite.', 'A Little Bit of Everything. Loaded Monster starts with a thick, chewy oatmeal cookie and packs in just about everything it can carry. Chocolate chips and peanut butter chips bring plenty of melty sweetness, while colorful M&M’s, crunchy pretzels, and buttery toffee bits add layers of salty, sweet, crunchy goodness. 

Every bite lands a little differently—which is exactly the point. It’s big, busy, and unapologetically loaded.', '', '2026-07-03', 17, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'loaded-monster', 'images/loaded-monster.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('birthday-bash', 'Birthday Bash', 'regular', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-004', 'Seasonal Flavor', 400, 'A soft vanilla birthday cookie loaded with creamy white chips and colorful rainbow sprinkles for a sweet, buttery, celebration-ready bite.', 'A celebration in every bite! This soft vanilla cookie is loaded with white chips and rainbow sprinkles.', 'Every Bite Deserves a Celebration. Birthday Bash turns classic birthday-cake energy into a thick, soft vanilla cookie. Creamy white chips add extra sweetness throughout, while rainbow sprinkles bring the color, crunch, and celebration. 

It’s buttery, vanilla-forward, cheerful, and ready for a party whether there’s actually a birthday or not.', '', '2026-06-07', 18, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'birthday-bash', 'images/birthday-bash.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('berry-bliss-cheesecake', 'Berry Bliss Cheesecake', 'specialty', 500, 0, 'active', 'OBA-005', 'Specialty', 500, 'A soft berry cookie swirled with sweet berry compote, filled with a creamy cheesecake center, and loaded with cream cheese chips for a fruity, cheesecake-inspired bite.', 'A soft cookie swirled with sweet berry compote and loaded with a cheesecake center with creamy cream cheese chips.', 'Berry Meets Cheesecake. Berry Bliss Cheesecake starts with a soft cookie swirled with sweet berry compote for bright, fruity flavor in every bite. Inside, a creamy cheesecake center adds a rich surprise, while cream cheese chips carry that tangy cheesecake flavor throughout the cookie. 

Fruity, creamy, soft, and decadent—it’s cheesecake and cookie in one.', '', '2026-06-07', 19, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'berry-bliss-cheesecake', 'images/berry-bliss-cheesecake.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('pb-classic', 'PB Classic', 'regular', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-007', 'Classic', 400, 'A soft and chewy peanut butter cookie with a balanced mix of sweet, salty, and rich roasted peanut flavor. OBA’s straightforward take on the peanut butter classic.', 'Soft and Chewy peanut butter cookie with the perfect balance of sweet, salty and nutty goodness.', 'Peanut Butter, Plain and Simple. PB Classic is all about the flavor that made peanut butter cookies a classic in the first place. A soft, chewy cookie delivers rich roasted peanut butter flavor with just the right balance of sweetness, saltiness, and nutty goodness. 

No complicated extras—just a comforting peanut butter cookie done the OBA way.', '', '2026-06-20', 20, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'pb-classic', 'images/pb-classic.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('safari-snacks', 'Safari Snacks', 'unclassified', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-008', 'Furry Friends Treat', 400, 'Peanut butter and banana baked dog treats from OBA’s Furry Friends Treat collection. Each package includes two cookies made especially for your four-legged friend.', 'Peanut butter, banana cookie made for man''s best friend! Our Furry Friends Treats, baked just for the good boys and girls.

2 cookies in each package', 'A Treat for the Furry Longnecks at Heart. Safari Snacks make sure the four-legged members of the OBA family get something from the bakery too. 

These peanut butter and banana cookies are baked as OBA’s Furry Friends Treats for the good boys and girls tagging along on the adventure. 
Each package includes two treats made especially for your furry friend.', '', '2026-06-20', 21, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'safari-snacks', 'images/safari-snacks.jpg', 'treat') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('maple-bacon-goodness', 'Maple Bacon Goodness', 'specialty', 500, 0, 'active', 'OBA-009', 'Specialty', 500, 'A sweet maple bacon cookie topped with crispy bacon and maple glaze, combining rich maple sweetness with smoky, salty bacon crunch.', 'Sweet maple bacon cookie topped with crispy bacon and maple glaze.', 'Sweet, Salty, and Worth Waking Up For. Maple Bacon Goodness brings breakfast flavors into cookie territory with a sweet maple-forward cookie and plenty of salty bacon flavor. 

Crispy bacon on top adds a savory crunch before a maple glaze finishes everything with another layer of rich sweetness. It’s salty, sweet, smoky, and unmistakably maple-bacon from the first bite.', '', '2026-06-20', 22, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'maple-bacon-goodness', 'images/maple-bacon-goodness.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('cherry-float-sandwich', 'Cherry Float Sandwich Cookie', 'specialty', 500, 0, 'active', 'OBA-010', 'Specialty', 500, 'Two soft root beer cookies sandwiched around creamy root beer float frosting and a sweet cherry cheesecake center for a nostalgic soda-shop-inspired dessert.', 'Soft root beer cookies sandwiched around a creamy root beer float frosting and a sweet cherry cheesecake center for the ultimate soda-shop-inspired treat.', 'The Soda Shop, Sandwiched. Cherry Float Sandwich Cookie takes the nostalgic flavors of a root beer float and builds them into one seriously playful dessert. Two soft root beer cookies sandwich a creamy root beer float frosting and a sweet cherry cheesecake center. 

The result is creamy, fruity, fizzy-inspired nostalgia packed into a soft sandwich cookie.', '', '2026-06-14', 23, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'cherry-float-sandwich', 'images/cherry-float-sandwich.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('red-velvet-dream', 'Red Velvet Dream', 'regular', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-012', 'Seasonal Flavor', 400, 'A thick, soft-baked red velvet cookie loaded with creamy white chocolate chips for a rich cocoa-and-vanilla bite inspired by classic red velvet.', 'A rich red velvet cookie loaded with creamy white chocolate chips. Soft, thick, and bakery-style in every bite.', 'Soft, Rich, and Dreamy. Red Velvet Dream turns the classic red velvet flavor into a thick, soft-baked OBA cookie. The rich red velvet base has a smooth cocoa sweetness, while creamy white chocolate chips melt throughout for little pockets of extra richness. 

Simple, soft, and decadent, it’s everything a red velvet lover wants in cookie form.', '', '2026-07-03', 24, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'red-velvet-dream', 'images/red-velvet-dream.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
INSERT INTO commerce_products (product_id, name, classification, unit_price_cents, unit_price_approved, status, oba_product_id, editorial_type, price_source_cents, google_description, hotplate_description, website_description, social_description, date_added, featured_priority, ingredients, allergens, reference_availability, slug, image_path, product_kind) VALUES ('stars-and-sprinkles', 'Stars & Sprinkles', 'regular', 400, 0, 'active', 'OBA-013', 'Seasonal Flavor', 400, 'A thick, soft vanilla sugar cookie topped with fluffy vanilla frosting and festive red, white, and blue sprinkles for a buttery Fourth of July treat.', 'A thick, soft vanilla sugar cookie topped with fluffy vanilla frosting and finished with festive red, white & blue sprinkles. A sweet Fourth of July classic that’s soft, buttery, and loaded with holiday charm.', 'A Little Red, White & Baked. Stars & Sprinkles starts with a thick, soft vanilla sugar cookie with a buttery sweetness and tender center. A fluffy layer of vanilla frosting goes on top before a shower of festive red, white, and blue sprinkles finishes the celebration. 

Soft, sweet, colorful, and made for Fourth of July cookie cravings.', '', '2026-07-03', 25, '', '', 'Unavailable', 'stars-and-sprinkles', 'images/stars-and-sprinkles.jpg', 'cookie') ON CONFLICT(product_id) DO UPDATE SET oba_product_id=excluded.oba_product_id, name=excluded.name, editorial_type=excluded.editorial_type, price_source_cents=excluded.price_source_cents, google_description=excluded.google_description, hotplate_description=excluded.hotplate_description, website_description=excluded.website_description, social_description=excluded.social_description, date_added=excluded.date_added, featured_priority=excluded.featured_priority, ingredients=excluded.ingredients, allergens=excluded.allergens, reference_availability=excluded.reference_availability, slug=excluded.slug, image_path=excluded.image_path, product_kind=excluded.product_kind, updated_at=CURRENT_TIMESTAMP;
